OL,3,ABrazil's Lula bans online gambling
OL,4,Aahead of presidential election
OL,5,
OL,6,FFlavio Bolsonaro accused his rival of
OL,7,Fplaying politics, while Brazilian
OL,8,Ffootball teams said the ban could lose
OL,9,Fthem income due to betting firms
OL,10,Fpulling their sponsorships.
